From: H3C HW-A mainline review
Subject: [RFC] dt-bindings: qcom: describe existing IPQ5018 compatibles

The IPQ5018 SoC DTS uses the existing driver compatibles. Accept its MDIO
compatible pair and the single IPQ5018 TSENS compatible in their bindings.
The MDIO driver matches qcom,ipq5018-mdio directly; it does not match the
legacy qcom,ipq40xx-mdio fallback string, which is retained in the existing
SoC DTS for compatibility with downstream consumers.

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipq4019-mdio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipq4019-mdio.yaml
@@ -14,6 +14,10 @@ properties:
       - enum:
           - qcom,ipq4019-mdio
           - qcom,ipq5018-mdio
+
+      - items:
+          - const: qcom,ipq5018-mdio
+          - const: qcom,ipq40xx-mdio
 
       - items:
           - enum:
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/qcom-tsens.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/thermal/qcom-tsens.yaml
@@ -19,5 +19,8 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
+      - description: IPQ5018 TSENS
+        const: qcom,ipq5018-tsens
+
       - description: msm8960 TSENS based
         items:
           - enum:
